xt-wg (0.6.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging modelled on xtables-addons.
    - xt-wg-common: userspace iptables plugins (libxt_WGOBFS.so,
      libxt_WGANYCAST.so, libxt_WGPTCP.so).
    - xt-wg-source: kernel-module source tarball for use with
      module-assistant ("m-a a-i xt-wg").
    - xt-wg-dkms: kernel-module source for DKMS auto-rebuild.

